CLI build needs DevEco's bundled JBR, otherwise PackageHap fails with 00308018 "Unable to locate a Java Runtime":
JAVA_HOME=/Applications/DevEco-Studio.app/Contents/jbr/Contents/Home, DEVECO_SDK_HOME=/Applications/DevEco-Studio.app/Contents/sdk, node from Contents/tools/node/bin, run `node Contents/tools/hvigor/bin/hvigorw.js ... assembleHap --no-daemon`. Output is unsigned HAP; `hdc install -r` works on emulator 127.0.0.1:5555 (bundle com.hefengbao.jingmo.hw). hdc lives in Contents/sdk/default/openharmony/toolchains (not on PATH by default; harness runner needs it on PATH).

